```

Here's an example usage:

```cpp
#include <iostream>

int main() {
    std::string markdownInput = "#Header Text _Emphasis bolded text_";
    std::string htmlOutput = convertMarkdownToHTML(markdownInput);
    std::cout << htmlOutput << std::endl; // <h1><em>Header Text</em><strong>bolded text</strong></h1>
